{"4212650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horns", "steam_appid": 4212650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORNS </strong>is a dark fantasy action RPG that combines the atmosphere and depth of classic RPGs with modern third-person combat, cinematic storytelling, and exploration-driven progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a ruined, unfamiliar place with only one purpose: find Lord Egannon, the arcanist accused of bringing slaughter to the capital, and uncover whether the king you once served is still alive. But the deeper you travel into the shadows, the more the truth begins to twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/04870ad62dbb959cc48f7851eb4a958f.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/04870ad62dbb959cc48f7851eb4a958f.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/04870ad62dbb959cc48f7851eb4a958f.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with sword, shield, magic, and forbidden powers. Chain light attacks into combos, break enemies with heavy strikes, evade, roll, block, and learn when survival depends on patience rather than force. Weapons and shields have durability, resources matter, and every encounter can punish careless decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/331d7cb771d18ec46af9a3f753515708.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/331d7cb771d18ec46af9a3f753515708.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/331d7cb771d18ec46af9a3f753515708.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Horns</strong> is built for players who enjoy exploration. There is no hand-holding map guiding every step. Instead, you must read the world, follow signs, listen to memories and monologues, search hidden places, and discover weapons, armor, shields, keys, secrets, and items that can change the way you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, you will gain access to powers beyond steel. Fire magic, mystical seeds, ancient artifacts, and the strange realm of <strong>Nyxar</strong> open new tactical possibilities. Enemies can be outplayed, slowed, avoided, or destroyed, but every power comes with a question: what is it doing to you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where evil has a shape, and that shape begins to grow from your own body, <strong>Horns</strong> asks one question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you hunting the darkness, or becoming it?</strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/50a6e77fa81b3ed8fd75793ecc90ac3e.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/50a6e77fa81b3ed8fd75793ecc90ac3e.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/50a6e77fa81b3ed8fd75793ecc90ac3e.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/3c2bd37608a8fb19bb141e96556c63de.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/3c2bd37608a8fb19bb141e96556c63de.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/3c2bd37608a8fb19bb141e96556c63de.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/7a08bee0d68c45cb612788c38d199d82.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/7a08bee0d68c45cb612788c38d199d82.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/7a08bee0d68c45cb612788c38d199d82.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/8e9d8e8d0d60326b000e1bc698c0cb68.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/8e9d8e8d0d60326b000e1bc698c0cb68.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/8e9d8e8d0d60326b000e1bc698c0cb68.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/e877a5db90b6d238efa34c4ffc381e3c.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/e877a5db90b6d238efa34c4ffc381e3c.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/e877a5db90b6d238efa34c4ffc381e3c.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nyxar Realm Mechanics</strong> – Slow down the world while you move freely and turn every fight into your advantage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hourstride</strong> - a phenomenon where time moves swiftly, and the night is not meant for the unwary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Strike Finish Moves</strong> – Eliminate enemies instantly with precise, brutal executions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Combat</strong> – Combine melee, magic, and horn powers in fluid, skill-driven battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Playstyle</strong> – Become a fighter, arcanist, or master of horns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters</strong> – Face powerful rulers of Velharion in intense fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Secrets</strong> – Discover hidden items, creatures, and mysteries across dark villages, forests, and dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression System</strong> – Upgrade your horns and unlock new abilities as you grow stronger</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HORNS </strong>is a dark fantasy action RPG that combines the atmosphere and depth of classic RPGs with modern third-person combat, cinematic storytelling, and exploration-driven progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a ruined, unfamiliar place with only one purpose: find Lord Egannon, the arcanist accused of bringing slaughter to the capital, and uncover whether the king you once served is still alive. But the deeper you travel into the shadows, the more the truth begins to twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/04870ad62dbb959cc48f7851eb4a958f.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/04870ad62dbb959cc48f7851eb4a958f.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/04870ad62dbb959cc48f7851eb4a958f.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with sword, shield, magic, and forbidden powers. Chain light attacks into combos, break enemies with heavy strikes, evade, roll, block, and learn when survival depends on patience rather than force. Weapons and shields have durability, resources matter, and every encounter can punish careless decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/331d7cb771d18ec46af9a3f753515708.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/331d7cb771d18ec46af9a3f753515708.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/331d7cb771d18ec46af9a3f753515708.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Horns</strong> is built for players who enjoy exploration. There is no hand-holding map guiding every step. Instead, you must read the world, follow signs, listen to memories and monologues, search hidden places, and discover weapons, armor, shields, keys, secrets, and items that can change the way you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, you will gain access to powers beyond steel. Fire magic, mystical seeds, ancient artifacts, and the strange realm of <strong>Nyxar</strong> open new tactical possibilities. Enemies can be outplayed, slowed, avoided, or destroyed, but every power comes with a question: what is it doing to you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where evil has a shape, and that shape begins to grow from your own body, <strong>Horns</strong> asks one question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you hunting the darkness, or becoming it?</strong><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/50a6e77fa81b3ed8fd75793ecc90ac3e.poster.avif?t=1787676556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/50a6e77fa81b3ed8fd75793ecc90ac3e.webm?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/50a6e77fa81b3ed8fd75793ecc90ac3e.mp4?t=1787676556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4212650/extras/3c2b